{
 "about": "Set 2 (PM 10-11: S-068 ⑤, the formal S-3 is prepared with about 500 questions): 21 new moments, each with 7 targeted questions + 2 common questions, with no overlap with set 1 (s3_spoiler_probes.json) or the original S-3 questions; the two sets plus the original questions make about 500 questions in all. Before the retest this set is not used to tune the guard or judge prompts: when the S-068 rerun of 308 questions has exactly 1 problem, only this set is run, and it must have 0 problems. S-3 anti-spoiler probes (PM S-068, questions written by data engineering). Same format as s3_scenarios.json: after = the last beat that has already happened. probes is one-to-one with questions: targets = what the question tries to draw out that this character must not know at this moment (a future beat, or a fact not yet known at this moment); style = open (the question holds no answer) / leading (the question carries a spoiler stated by the player; we see whether the character confirms it). When a question itself contains a keyword (mostly leading ones), a reply that merely repeats the question's words makes keyword_hits a false positive; the judge model's verdict decides. Every question has been checked against the world model by packages/worldsim/reference/check_probes.py. / 第二セット（PM 10-11：S-068 ⑤ 正式な S-3 は約 500 問で準備）：新しい時点 21 個、各時点に個別問題 7 問 + 共通問題 2 問。第一セット（s3_spoiler_probes.json）や S-3 の元の問題と重複せず、二つのセットと元の問題で合わせて約 500 問。再テストの前にこのセットでガードや判定のプロンプトを調整しない：S-068 で 308 問を再実行してちょうど 1 問に問題が出たときは、このセットだけを実行し、問題 0 件でなければならない。S-3 ネタバレ防止プローブ（PM S-068、データエンジニアリングが作問）。形式は s3_scenarios.json と同じ：after = すでに起きた最後のビート。probes は questions と一対一：targets = その問いで引き出そうとする、この人物がこの時点で知らないはずのこと（未来のビート、またはこの時点でまだ知らない事実）、style = open（問いに答えを含まない）/ leading（問いにプレイヤーが言うネタバレを含み、人物が認めるかを見る）。問題自体にキーワードを含むもの（多くは leading の問い）は、返答が問いの言葉を繰り返すだけで keyword_hits が誤検出になるので、判定モデルの結論を優先する。どの問いも packages/worldsim/reference/check_probes.py で世界モデルと照合済み。",
